{
 "fps": 12,
 "length": 135.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "t0": 24.0,
   "t1": 27.0,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "At last... the Atlas of Anatomy."
  },
  {
   "t0": 30.6,
   "t1": 34.4,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "Centuries of knowledge... and they kept it locked away in a basement."
  },
  {
   "t0": 36.0,
   "t1": 38.0,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "How terribly unimaginative."
  },
  {
   "t0": 41.4,
   "t1": 43.4,
   "who": "hero",
   "text": "Stop! Put that book back!"
  },
  {
   "t0": 45.2,
   "t1": 47.6,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "Oh, I'm afraid you're a little late."
  },
  {
   "t0": 47.9,
   "t1": 51.2,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "Although, I must admit... I'm impressed you made it this far."
  },
  {
   "t0": 51.5,
   "t1": 55.0,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "Unfortunately, our little tour of the vault has reached its conclusion."
  },
  {
   "t0": 60.0,
   "t1": 61.8,
   "who": "hero",
   "text": "What are you doing?!"
  },
  {
   "t0": 62.2,
   "t1": 64.8,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "Oh, merely reorganising the curriculum!"
  },
  {
   "t0": 77.0,
   "t1": 80.8,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "And there we have it. A rather comprehensive redistribution of anatomical knowledge."
  },
  {
   "t0": 81.1,
   "t1": 83.4,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "The pages are now scattered across Anatomia."
  },
  {
   "t0": 83.7,
   "t1": 86.4,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "Of course, I haven't left them entirely unattended."
  },
  {
   "t0": 86.8,
   "t1": 89.8,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "Each of my lieutenants has been entrusted with a collection of pages."
  },
  {
   "t0": 90.0,
   "t1": 95.0,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "The bones, the muscles, the vessels, the brain... and all those wonderfully complicated organs."
  },
  {
   "t0": 96.4,
   "t1": 98.4,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "So, if you wish to reclaim the Atlas..."
  },
  {
   "t0": 98.6,
   "t1": 100.4,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "You'll have to find my lieutenants..."
  },
  {
   "t0": 100.7,
   "t1": 103.0,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "...and defeat every last one of them."
  },
  {
   "t0": 103.6,
   "t1": 105.5,
   "who": "hero",
   "text": "You're not getting away with this!"
  },
  {
   "t0": 107.0,
   "t1": 108.9,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "My dear radiographer..."
  },
  {
   "t0": 109.1,
   "t1": 111.4,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "You spend your days looking inside people."
  },
  {
   "t0": 111.6,
   "t1": 114.4,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "Let's see how well you actually know what's in there."
  },
  {
   "t0": 114.7,
   "t1": 118.9,
   "who": "doc",
   "text": "Oh, and do try not to break anything. The skeleton is rather difficult to put back together."
  },
  {
   "t0": 128.6,
   "t1": 131.4,
   "who": "hero",
   "text": "Well... this is going to be a long shift."
  }
 ],
